* @title ARBNO backtracks through alternative subpatterns
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2, Section 2.18
* @expect >>>
*
* 1234
* 12341234
* 1234123
* 123
* 123412
* 123412341
* <<<
          &ANCHOR = 1
          P = '1234' | '123' | '234' | '341' | '412'
          ARBNOTEST = ARBNO(P) $ OUTPUT RPOS(0)
          '123412341' ARBNOTEST
END
